msgstr "C'est... vrai."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: hime_anime/Nekoboru_2/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Nekoboru"
msgid "I... just... am so afraid of the same thing happening to her that did me! Do you blame me for caring too much?"
